## Context

The memory design reached v4 after four external reviews and a working session
with the author. `docs/2026-09-10-dragon-memory-design.md` is the settled architecture; this ticket tracks
turning it into code. It stays open until every child is merged and the
integration review in `/roar` step 8 has run.

The architecture in one paragraph: the store is the bodies, one file per memory
under git; `MEMORY.md` is generated as the top N by score and written only by
the consolidation pass, so a session's writes and the index's writes are
disjoint sets; nothing is ever deleted, and the only removal from a project
directory is promotion into the harness tier; a memory declares what it is true
*while*, and expiry only unranks, so it is reversible; and a declared class
stays resident regardless of score, because falling below the cut removes
awareness, not merely reachability.

## Children, in wave order

**Wave 1 — independent of everything.**

- `0908` — promotion marks the project copy dead in the form the walker reads
- `0911` — frontmatter migration: one type field, one shape, across the corpus
- `0913` — retire the dead retention machinery and ship the resident search line

**Wave 2.**

- `0910` — generate the memory index as the top N of its directory *(needs 0913:
  until the resident search line exists, a body below the cut has no documented
  way back)*

**Wave 3.**

- `0914` — `valid_while` grammar, resolver, scorer integration and `supersedes`
  *(needs 0910's generator and 0911's uniform frontmatter)*
- `0915` — enforce the validity predicate on the write path *(needs 0914; and it
  begins by establishing whether a write path exists as code at all)*

**Wave 4.**

- `0912` — consolidation pass: deterministic pooling, grouping and reports
  *(needs 0908, 0910 and 0914)*

**Wave 5.**

- `0916` — model-judged merge, reviewed promotion, tombstoning *(needs 0912)*

An earlier version of this tracker said only `0912` had a real prerequisite and
named `0908`. That was wrong in both directions: `0912` depends on three
siblings, and `0910` depends on `0913`.

## Deliberately not children

A decay pass, a corpus cap, an orphan collector, and a full-catalogue file. §5
of the design removes the need for all four; `0913` deletes the machinery that
survives from them. They are listed here so a later reader does not re-derive
them as gaps.

Parked rather than planned: the embedding database and its content-hash cache.
The design describes them; nothing depends on them, and `0912` ships without
them.

## Open decision carried by a child

`0910` records it: **what "recency" means as a score input.** Provenance dates
are batch-stamped and filesystem mtimes reset on clone, so neither is a usable
signal as it stands. Either settle it in `0910` or score without recency.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] All eight children merged
- [ ] Child diffs re-read together, not only individually
- [ ] `make check` passes on the union
- [ ] The design's §6 and Annex A match what shipped, or the design is amended
